# The order of a cycle said with the unit and no free words ("what day comes after Monday"): a signal of this world, read whole even on the Talk tab; without the unit ("what comes after March") it stays Talk's (its cards), and so does the order of months (Talk's own rows: "Which month comes before January?").
@pat.time.calendar.order.weekday core.pattern
    match="[$lang.lead.filler]? [$lang.time.list]? [$lang.time.glue]? {u:lex.time.calendar.unit} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.time.later|$lang.time.earlier] {x:lex.time.calendar.weekday} [$lang.tail.filler|please]?"
    emit="@{_} core.request action=time.read arg.text=\"{segment}\""
    kind=question
    priority=14
    signal=true
    example="What day comes after Monday?"
    canonical="What day comes after Monday?"

@pat.time.calendar.order.season core.pattern
    match="[$lang.lead.filler]? [$lang.time.list]? [$lang.time.glue]? {u:lex.time.calendar.unit} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.time.later|$lang.time.earlier] {x:lex.time.calendar.season} [$lang.tail.filler|please]?"
    emit="@{_} core.request action=time.read arg.text=\"{segment}\""
    kind=question
    priority=14
    signal=true
    example="What season comes after winter?"

# A question of one member and the words of the calendar only ("Which season is March in?", "Which months are in summer?", "How many days has April?"): no free words, a signal of this world.
@pat.time.calendar.member.weekday core.pattern
    match="[$lang.lead.filler]? [$lang.time.list|$lang.time.count]? [$lang.time.glue]? {u:lex.time.calendar.unit?} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.time.glue]? {x:lex.time.calendar.weekday} [$lang.time.glue]? {v:lex.time.calendar.unit?} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.tail.filler|please]?"
    emit="@{_} core.request action=time.read arg.text=\"{segment}\""
    kind=question
    priority=13
    signal=true
    example="How many days until Saturday?"

@pat.time.calendar.member.month core.pattern
    match="[$lang.lead.filler]? [$lang.time.list|$lang.time.count]? [$lang.time.glue]? {u:lex.time.calendar.unit?} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.time.glue]? {x:lex.time.calendar.month} [$lang.time.glue]? {v:lex.time.calendar.unit?} [$lang.time.glue]? [$lang.tail.filler|please]?"
